    <fullName>Split_Type__c</fullName>
    <description>Identifies the type of Commission Split.  The first value is for the Oppty Owner and the second for the Split Commission Rep.  The Sales Rep % and Split Rep % will auto-update after saving the Opportunity.  Custom can be used to set custom percentages.</description>
