75% / 75% - Healthcare (98/2) - 75 percent overlay 
75% / 25% - Owner/Split Rep
70% / 30% - Open Season
50% / 50% - 50% each
25% / 75% - Owner/Split Rep
100% / 100% - 100 percent overlay (99/1)
Custom - custom %</inlineHelpText>
